<br>
2) Mein Hu farzand e Nabi Gulshan E Haq ki kali<br>
Jaan e zehra o Ali Hoon Ali ibne wali<br>
Kya nahi tujhko Qabar Shimr Allah se dar ×2<br>
Dekh ye zulm na kar Mai hoon Islam ke Zaain. <br>
<br>
3)Mera Lashkar na raha Mera Akbar na Raha <br>
Mera Asghar Na raha koi Yaawar Na raha <br>
