Arsh par Mere liye hai bapa Shewan O Shaen <br>
<br>
4) Shimr Shaitaan hai tu Shimr Haiwaan hai tu<br>
Nange adiyaan hai tu jehl ki jaan hai tu<br>
Dushman e Deen E khuda Dushman e Rabe ullah x2<br>
Behaya tu bhai bada mein hu Imaan ki zaen <br>
<br>
5) Shimr Be deen bataa maine kya ki hai qataa<br>
